  "title": ".hack//Roots",
  "justification": "AniDB 4324's specials S1-S9 are Online Jack 1-9. TVDB 79099 season 0 lists Online Jack 01-03 as 0x24-0x26 and Online Jack 04-09 as 0x32-0x37, so each pairs by its number; the row sent all nine to no episode. TVDB dates all nine 2006-05-18 where AniDB has 2006-05-18 to 2007-01-18, a release-date difference the titles settle. TMDB 8864 season 0 lists no Online Jack, so the specials take no TMDB episode; by default they took E1-E9, the Liminality and Sign specials.",
